WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.360
Have you noticed?

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.660
Here on the internet,

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.445
Bernie Sanders is

00:00:04.445 --> 00:00:05.540
everywhere!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.220
Wall Street

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.000
Wall Street

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.520
and Wall Street

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.540
This matters because

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.780
in the betting for who will be the next president,

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.520
Donald Trump the incumbent leads but,

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.780
among Democrats,

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.500
Senator Sanders is among the top four.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.100
Thank you all very much.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.920
Let's go forward together!

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.930
And most people don't know that Sanders

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:32.480
has quietly built a digital media empire.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.900
That means he's in competition with me,

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.120
and he's winning!

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.420
His videos come out every few hours

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.450
and they've been viewed

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.780
almost a billion times.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:44.740
You are talking about oligarchy.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:45.980
Many of his videos

00:00:45.989 --> 00:00:47.073
are just him ranting

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.960
about how Republican ideas hurt people.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.260
Here he claims that the

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.420
repeal of Obamacare will kill Americans.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.080
Tens of thousands of them

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.160
will die.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.580
He ignores the thousands who may live

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.200
if the economy is allowed to grow.

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.280
Other Sanders videos

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.100
are edited, produced, propaganda pieces.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.680
Here, Sanders staff runs a Trump speech

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:25.020
where Trump quotes a song

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.956
about a woman who takes a snake into her home

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:29.840
and the snake then bites her.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.340
Trump uses it to take

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.860
an unfair, mean-spirited swipe against immigrants,

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.280
while arguing for tighter immigration controls.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:41.180
Sanders has every right to criticize that,

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.240
but then he runs a clip suggesting

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:46.220
that the president calls all minority immigrants

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:47.000
animals.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.180
But the video never mentions

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.680
that Trump's animal comment

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.060
was about the MS-13 gang.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:02.120
Another consistent theme in Sanders videos

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:04.740
is that lots of people on the right are

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:06.544
horrible, greedy people

00:02:06.544 --> 00:02:08.740
who scheme to get more money,

00:02:08.755 --> 00:02:10.050
in this case by

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:12.300
abolishing the estate tax.

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:17.240
They claim repeal will save Trump

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.460
four billion dollars.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.700
He doesn't mention that the estate tax

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.480
taxes money that was already taxed,

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.700
it's double taxation.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.560
He could still argue against repeal, but

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:32.640
he ought to be fair.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:40.020
Many Sanders videos demand that he make college free

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:42.160
because it's just too expensive.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.780
His staff interviews themselves.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:58.540
Again, there's no mention of how existing

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:00.220
tuition subsidies already increased

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.020
the price of tuition.

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:03.720
And there's not a peep about how

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:06.440
his own wife's shady financial dealings

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.400
bankrupted a college.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:09.320
It's just

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:10.600
government must pay more.

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.777
Government should take responsibility

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.640
for your health care too,

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:21.551
says this video

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:25.060
which describes MSNBC anchor Ali Velshi

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:27.440
as a Canadian capitalist.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.980
This is billed as a debate but

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.720
Republican Jim Jordan hardly gets to say anything.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:46.180
It's easy to win an argument

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.840
if you never let the other guy speak.

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.860
Almost all new income and wealth is going to

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.080
the top one percent.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.240
Probably the biggest theme in Bernie videos

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.000
is income inequality,

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.940
which Bernie says:

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.920
is not only immoral,

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.000
it is causing massive suffering.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:02.920
But he's just wrong.

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.640
The wealth gap doesn't cause suffering.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.580
Yes, rich people got richer,

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:12.160
but the poor and middle class got richer too.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.300
Bernie never says that.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:17.320
And the poor are getting poorer.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:20.680
Sanders posts a new, economically ignorant video

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:21.960
most every day.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.320
He says it would be easy

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.970
to have free health care, free college,

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.280
a living wage.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.040
How will it be paid for?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.060
Simple, raise taxes.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:36.960
Sanders says the responsible rich

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.200
want to pay more.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.620
So pay more!

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.320
No one's stopping you.

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.437
Or give to charity.

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.820
Charities will spend your money

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:47.880
better than government will.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.560
Socialists think government's the solution

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.000
to every problem

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.640
and they pretend that what government provides is free.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:56.760
Free education.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:57.820
Universal health care.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:58.940
A living wage.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.180
Bernie's videos would be just a joke

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:02.240
except

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.640
millions of people watch

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:07.580
and lots believe the nonsense he preaches.

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.300
We look at these figures and we say,

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.960
Oh unemployment is low, everything is

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:11.960
fine, right?

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:13.220
Well unemployment is low

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.640
because everyone has two jobs.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:15.840
What?

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.540
That's not how unemployment works.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.220
I don't know if she learned that from Bernie, but

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:23.900
Senator Sanders is the king

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:25.880
of economic ignorance.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.160
The top 10 percent

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:30.260
gets it all.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.440
Gets it all!

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.260
And a billion people watch.

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:35.980
You should know about that.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:36.764
We'll watch

00:05:36.764 --> 00:05:38.260
so you don't have to.

